    "detailed_description": "1920 year. New York. City of high hopes and broken dreams, friends and traitors. Can a humble guy Christopher, the son of a port worker, make his American dream come true?<br><br>Friends, we have great news! Collectible cards appeared in the game!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300430/extras/62b57b7e1cf5b90a15ad2d8d5465c7fb.avif?t=1687266777\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Magnificent gangster story </h2>Inspired by the best mafia dramas, we created an amazing \u201cmovie\u201d with convincing characters and a real mafia spirit.<br>In the game you will find numerous links to real characters and events. This is not just a game, it is a whole story! Playing <strong>Whiskey.Mafia. Leo Family</strong> you can take the role of a real gangster. You will do a lot of crook business from car theft to robbery of spirits warehouse. In the game you will meet both true friends and vile traitors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300430/extras/6bf6584cb6d2096edd9c4d3c977734fb.poster.avif?t=1687266777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300430/extras/6bf6584cb6d2096edd9c4d3c977734fb.webm?t=1687266777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300430/extras/6bf6584cb6d2096edd9c4d3c977734fb.mp4?t=1687266777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Dive into another world </h2>Detailed locations in PixelArt.<br>Pleasant atmosphere of the 1920s.<br>Original soundtrack.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300430/extras/37ba189340b057ec2972b1540e469d22.poster.avif?t=1687266777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300430/extras/37ba189340b057ec2972b1540e469d22.webm?t=1687266777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1300430/extras/37ba189340b057ec2972b1540e469d22.mp4?t=1687266777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features: </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> More than 10 game locations<br></li><li> Various mini-games<br></li><li> Achievements<br></li><li> Non-linear plot<br></li><li> Whiskey.Mafia.Jazz</li></ul>",
